# HoloSelf OS integration settings.
# Configure through the app's setup wizard, or export values in the environment
# before launching Tauri. A root .env is not automatically loaded by Rust.
# The wizard writes an .env file in the application configuration directory.

# Optional Gemini integration: contextual messages and PDF extraction.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional Cartesia text-to-speech. Native macOS speech is the fallback.
# CARTESIA_API_KEY=
